Only an explicitly earlier posting date warns; equal, later, and inherited dates are allowed.

========== API ==========

accounts()

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  format 1,000.00 SEK
  default
account Assets:Cash
account Assets:Bank
account Assets:Other
account Equity:Opening

2024-01-05 Undated postings
  Assets:Cash  1 SEK
  Equity:Opening  -1 SEK

2024-01-05 Mixed posting dates
  Assets:Cash  1 SEK ; [2024-01-04]
  Assets:Bank  -1 SEK ; [2024-01-05]
  Assets:Other  1 SEK ; [2024-01-06]
  Equity:Opening  -1 SEK

